---
// İletişim Modülü (Yeni Tasarım Dilinde 2 Şık Banner)
---
<div id="panel-iletisim" class="content-panel hidden w-full space-y-6 transition-all duration-300">
	<!-- ÜST BANNER: İletişim Başlığı -->
	<div class="w-full bg-gray-50/70 border border-gray-200/50 rounded-xl p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
		<div class="space-y-2">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 tracking-tight m-0">Bizimle İletişime Geçin</h2>
			<p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 max-w-md mx-auto">
				Arıcılık teknikleri, Ar-Ge süreçleri veya iş birlikleri hakkında merak ettiğiniz her konuda bizimle bağ kurabilirsiniz.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<!-- ALT BANNER: Detaylı Bilgi Tablosu -->
	<div class="w-full bg-gray-50/70 border border-gray-200/50 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden">
		<table class="w-full text-left border-collapse m-0">
			<tbody>
				<tr class="border-b border-gray-200/40 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100/30">
					<th class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-gray-500 w-1/3 sm:w-1/4 bg-gray-100/40">E-posta</th>
					<td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm">
						<a href="mailto:info@polinasyon.org" class="text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-700 no-underline font-extrabold transition-colors">info@polinasyon.org</a>
					</td>
				</tr>
				<tr class="border-b border-gray-200/40 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100/30">
					<th class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-gray-500 bg-gray-100/40">Lokasyon</th>
					<td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">Yunusemre, Manisa / Türkiye</td>
				</tr>
				<tr class="transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100/30">
					<th class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-gray-500 bg-gray-100/40">Çalışma Sahası</th>
					<td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">Simav & Çitgöl Bölgesi</td>
				</tr>
			</tbody>
		</table>
	</div>
</div>

